# This repository's verification lives mostly in npm-style lifecycle hooks: `precheck`,
# `postcheck`, `pretest` and `posttest` together hold 144 of the ~200 commands that make
# up `npm run check` and `npm test`. pnpm 7+ does not run those hooks unless asked, so
# without this line `pnpm run check` and `pnpm test` quietly executed about a third of
# the verification and still reported success.
#
# tests/verification-coverage.mjs fails if this setting is removed.
enable-pre-post-scripts=true
